        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation electricity</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation electricity
The multioutput-process 'natural gas, burned in cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation electricity' delivers the coproducts 'heat, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation electricity' and 'electricity, at cogen 160kWe lambda=1, allocation electricity'.;
UUID: c5245998-7087-3f3a-ab62-6a48f85940b7
The module includes fuel input, infrastructure, emissions to air, and substances needed for operation.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions.
Technology: Average technology available on market.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature. Manufacturer information. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c5245998-7087-3f3a-ab62-6a48f85940b7.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
